[2026-10-18 20:35:59] render_header(Ellipse)
[2026-10-18 20:35:59] render_paragraph(Figure formed by slicing a cone in a way that is not parallel to its axis or base. Ellipses can range from nearly circular to very elongated. The orbits of every permanent member of the solar system are ellipses.)
[2026-10-18 20:35:59] render_header(Elongation)
